{"id":"wb-7-1684","name":"伪满洲国中央银行旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"伪满洲国中央银行旧址","text":"伪满洲国中央银行旧址是一座位于中华人民共和国吉林省长春市朝阳区人民广场西北侧的历史建筑，由日本建筑师西村好时所设计，大林组建设。满洲国时期，该建筑为满洲中央银行总部使用。目前驻有中国人民银行长春中心支行、中国工商银行长春人民广场支行、中国农业银行长春人民广场支行等多家单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%AA%E6%BB%A1%E6%B4%B2%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90120981,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90120981","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/45140ac24abb5ca1cb3dc276.jpg","title":"中国人民银行长春分行-満洲中央銀行_Manchurian_Central_Bank_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E9%95%BF%E6%98%A5%E5%88%86%E8%A1%8C-%E6%BA%80%E6%B4%B2%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%8A%80%E8%A1%8C_Manchurian_Central_Bank_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E9%95%BF%E6%98%A5%E5%88%86%E8%A1%8C-%E6%BA%80%E6%B4%B2%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%8A%80%E8%A1%8C_Manchurian_Central_Bank_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"wanghongliu","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"中国人民银行长春分行----満洲中央銀行 Manchurian Central Bank","width":320,"height":213}}